       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Interactions:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " K supp · K salt substitutes · ACE-I or ARB raise hyperkalemia risk; stop K supp in HF pts starting spironolactone & recheck K when ACE-I/ARB chgs"
     }
    ]
